        openings: ("After the bar closed at 1:45 a.m., {D} lay on the sidewalk and began shouting at 2 a.m. The bar manager asked {DL} to move twice, and a street camera caught the whole scene.", "The defense evidence will establish that {D} was drunk, loud, and foolish, but caused no harm and threatened no one. {D.He} moved when deputies asked."),
        closings: ("A person lying on a sidewalk, shouting after closing, who was told twice to move and did not. Neighbors above the bar lost sleep.", "A drunk and foolish night, with no threat and no harm. This is a minor matter, and the State has not shown more than a person who needed to go home."),
        timeline: [(0, "1:45 a.m.: closing."), (0, "2 a.m.: the shouting.")],
        identified: "Street Camera",
        mood: .indifferent,
        genders: ["D": .male])

    static let resortRobes = SmallCases.make(
